<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL Finance 5.25 pct notes due 2003 AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL Finance 5.25 pct notes due 2003 AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Thursday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to the 250 million mark 5.25 percent notes due 2003 of DSL Finance N.V.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by Deutsche Siedlungs- und Landesrentenbank (DSL Bank).</p>
<p>IBCA said the rating was based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44-171-542 8663</p>
</text>
